# Mirror Sync Contract

Use this rule when editing portable Hoveath source files, Cursor projection core files, or suspected mirror drift.

Invoke `hoveath-mirror-sync`.

Source-of-truth lives in `09_soul/` for portable identity and skill material. `09_cursor/` is the Cursor projection and may include project-local addenda.

Do not edit a mirrored source section in `09_cursor/` when the intended change belongs in `09_soul/`.

After changing portable source material, check and refresh all registered projections using the mirror sync protocol. Keep source, `09_claude/`, `09_cursor/`, and manifest changes together when affected.
